4.10 Challenges Encountered
During implementation, several challenges were experienced:
•	High cost of commercial poultry feeds.
•	Mortality of nine birds during the production period.
•	Cold weather conditions experienced in Limuru.
•	Fluctuating prices of poultry inputs.
•	Limited financial resources.
•	Water shortages during dry periods.
•	Time constraints due to the school academic programme.
Despite these challenges, the project remained successful because corrective measures were implemented promptly.
